Verify traffic rates are correct for Step 1
    #UE1
    Run keyword and continue on failure    Verify that DL throughput for NR-UE1 on SCell-0 is about 12.0 MBps
    Run keyword and continue on failure    Verify that DL throughput for NR-UE1 on SCell-2 is about 7.0 MBps
    Run keyword and continue on failure    Verify that DL throughput for NR-UE1 on SCell-3 is about 4.4 MBps

